WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Today is the day before your procedure, and this is the most important day of

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.720
your prep,

3
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.580
so let's make it count. Starting today, you must drink clear liquids only,

4
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.720
which includes water,

5
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.890
broth, plain tea, black coffee, clear juices, and plain gelatin. Stay well hyd

6
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:16.560
rated throughout

7
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.420
the day, and remember, no solid foods, no alcohol, and no dairy. Avoid anything

8
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:21.920
red,

9
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:25.250
purple, blue, or orange, as these dyes can be mistaken for blood during the

10
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.000
procedure.

11
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.200
Begin your bowel prep exactly when your prep instruction sheet says to. Don't

12
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.000
skip ahead or

13
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.030
delay. If you're on a split-dose schedule, your second dose will be taken the

14
00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:36.880
morning of your

15
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:41.220
procedure. Your instruction sheet will have the exact timing for that. One

16
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.240
important note about

17
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.120
your ride tomorrow, ride shares and taxis are fine for getting you to your

18
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:46.880
procedure,

19
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.900
but after your procedure, you may only use a ride share or taxi if a companion

20
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.240
who is 18 or older

21
00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:56.290
is in the car with you. Going home alone in a ride share or taxi is not

22
00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.760
permitted. Please make

23
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:01.760
sure you have that arranged in advance. You're almost there. Stick with it.
